<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n32288" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">ŏdōrus</span></b> , a, um,
			adj.
		id., <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b><i>emitting a scent</i> or <i>odor</i>, <i>odorous</i> (mostly <b>poet.</b>
			and in post-Aug. prose for odoratus). </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b>
			<b>Lit.</b>
		</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>A.</b>
			<i>Sweet-smelling</i>, <i>fragrant</i>: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">flos,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Ov. M.
					9, 87</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">arbor, i. e. myrrha,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">id. A.
					A. 1, 287</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">res,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Varr. L. L. 6, § 83</span></i>
			 Müll. dub.—<i>Comp.</i>: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">odorius,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Plin.
					20, 17, 69, § 177</span></i>
			.—<i>Sup.</i>: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">nardum Syriacum odorissimum,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Isid. 17, 9, 3</span></i>
			.—</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>B.</b>
			<i>Ill-smelling</i>, <i>stinking</i>
			(post-class.): 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">lumen odorum Sulfure,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Claud. VI. Cons. Hon. 324</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>II.</b>
			<b>Transf.</b>, <i>that tracks by the
				smell</i>, <i>keenscented</i>: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">odora canum vis (= copia odororum canum),</span>”
				<i>pack of sharp-scented hounds</i>,
				 <i><span class="en">Verg.
					A. 4, 132</span></i>
			.</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
